==Trivia==
*This event is based on a Japanese proverb which likens the experience of taking one's final exams to fighting a battle.
*In the Japanese poster for Go Go Graduates!, the text "戦友・努力・勝利" can be seen above the event's name; this means "Friendship, Hard Work, Victory", the three principles of [[wikipedia:Weekly Shōnen Jump|''Shōnen Jump'']].
*The enemy base used in these stages resembles a Japanese [[wikipedia:Daruma doll|''Daruma'' doll]].
*It was first released only 5 days after the infamous [[wikipedia:Parkland high school shooting|Stoneman Douglas High School]] shooting, back in February 2018.
**This may be why it took nearly a year to be released outside of [[Nyanko Daisensou]].
*[[Bang-Bang]] is missing in the [[Media:Eve l 047 1 en.png|event poster]] for the 2026 event.

